  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.11.0 - AM050 Redundant MapFrom False-Positive Fixes\n\n            🛡️ Analyzer Improvements (AM050):\n            - Redundant MapFrom detection now validates AutoMapper symbols for both MapFrom and ForMember\n            - Redundancy now only triggers for direct source-lambda member access (src => src.Property)\n            - Prevents false positives from captured variables and similarly named non-AutoMapper APIs\n\n            ✅ Validation:\n            - Added regression tests for captured-variable mappings and non-AutoMapper ForMember/MapFrom patterns\n            - All 450 tests passing locally (438 passed, 12 skipped)\n\n            Previous Release: v2.10.0 - AM041 Accuracy & Fix Safety",
